  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_stone_sphere.png",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Earthbound)</em> at level 5; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You were built for caves, collapse, and consequences.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Deep-Blooded.</strong> You have advantage on saving throws against poison and environmental exhaustion. You can’t be surprised by structural failure (collapsing ceilings, buckling catwalks) unless you are unconscious.</p>\n        <p><strong>Worksite Authority.</strong> You gain proficiency with mason’s tools or carpenter’s tools. If you already have both, you gain expertise with one.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
